  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-beta.3.2 wrapping ZVec C++ 0.5.1. Linux teardown ownership fix (#619). Pack-required natives: win-x64, linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-arm64, osx-x64, android-arm64/x64, ios-arm64, iossimulator-arm64. Soft: win-arm64 (#622), maccatalyst-arm64 (best-effort). See README Native RIDs and CHANGELOG.",
